KiCad Track Gloss
=================

IMPORTANT CODE PROVENANCE
-------------------------

This plugin is directly derived from the work and source code of DrAndyHaas.
It contains code, algorithms, and implementation patterns reused and adapted
from KiCadRoutingTools:

    https://github.com/drandyhaas/KiCadRoutingTools

This is not merely conceptual inspiration. Derived material includes
track-chain recognition, 0/45/90-degree octolinear smoothing, shortcut search,
improvement gating, geometry checks, and connectivity-preservation logic.

The standalone-plugin modifications in this branch were created with
ChatGPT/Codex (OpenAI), at the project owner's direction. These modifications
include selection-seeded scoping, the KiCad 10 ActionPlugin and SWIG adapter,
automatic connection expansion, deterministic batch planning, sliding T
terminations, additional safety checks, rollback, diagnostics, warning-bell
behavior, regression fixtures, tests, documentation, branding, and PCM
packaging.

The standalone adaptation was created by ChatGPT/Codex (OpenAI), inspired by
and reusing part of DrAndyHaas's code, and is maintained by Frantz. This
adaptation does not diminish or replace that primary provenance.

The active project repository is the fca1 KiCadRoutingTools fork:

    https://github.com/fca1/KiCadRoutingTools

